"""
SINGLE SOURCE for the ten use-case labs (v2.0).

Day 1 — Hermes Agent (Topic 2): one company, one campaign, from a single agent to a
multi-agent studio with a human at every checkpoint.
Day 2 — Paperclip (Topic 3): the same company run as a governed company of agents.

Running scenario: Kopi Kaki Co. (fictional Singapore kopi chain) launches the
"Gula Melaka Cold Brew" with the #ShiokColdBrew campaign.

Each lab drives: the deck's lab slides, the Learner Guide chapter, the Lesson Plan
row, labs/labNN-*/README.md + LAB-NN-Instructions.pdf + COPY-PROMPTS.txt, and the
Lab Prompts page (prompts/index.html).

Step keys: title, body (instructions), cmd (terminal), prompt (copy-ready text for an
agent), where (where to paste the prompt), expect (what you should see).
"""

WS = "~/kopi-kaki"          # the learner's workspace folder

COMMON_DATA = ["agents", "brand", "brief", "compliance", "catalogue"]

