 scenario="The campaign is planned; now it must run every day without you babysitting it. Each morning Mia sends you the day's post and image on Telegram. Only when you reply APPROVE does she publish it to the brand's Telegram channel and log it. She also works through the comment inbox — answering simple questions, but escalating food-safety, allergy, legal, billing, media and halal questions to you with personal data masked.",
